# Design notes — contact links, Mingl handle, Papi's ClubTech gallery photos

Resume: `@contact-links$`.

## Phone and email (every page)

- Telephone and email stay real links (`tel:` / `mailto:`) so a tap dials or opens mail.
- **No underline**: one global rule in `styles.css` — `a[href^="tel:"],a[href^="mailto:"]{text-decoration:none!important}` plus a `:focus-visible` outline so keyboard users still see focus. Every page that shows contact info loads `styles.css` (Display / preview pages do not show contact info).
- Do not add per-page underline overrides or turn phone/email into plain text.

## Mingl handle

`floqr-identity.js`: **FloqR handle = Mingl handle**. On the Club Public Profile Contact & Socials row the first button is that handle; it is labeled **Mingl** with the `@handle` beside it (`.club-mingl-handle`), matching the other platform-labeled buttons (Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, X). Brand name is never translated.

